SimulIDE - third party notices
==============================

ngspice
-------
The optional "Accurate analog (ngspice)" engine (src/simulator/spice) uses
ngspice, the open source mixed-signal circuit simulator:

    https://ngspice.sourceforge.io/

ngspice is NOT bundled with SimulIDE. The shared library (libngspice,
e.g. Debian/Ubuntu package "libngspice0") is loaded at runtime when it is
installed; SimulIDE runs normally without it. The few API type declarations
needed to talk to it (src/simulator/spice/ngspice-api.h) follow the public
interface in ngspice's sharedspice.h.

