Semiconductor model parameters
------------------------------
The device presets in src/simulator/elements/active/e-semimodel.cpp
(1N4148, 1N4007, 1N5819, 2N2222, 2N2907, 2N3904, 2N3906, BC547, BC557, ...)
use standard SPICE parameters taken from the widely published vendor SPICE
models of those parts (or fitted to their datasheets where noted in the
source). The convergence aids (pnjlim, fetlim, limvds) follow the
algorithms described for Berkeley SPICE3 / ngspice.
